flowchart TD
    T[Typed SubprocessContract] --> A[Runtime assignment with artifact descriptors]
    A --> P[Exact tool/capability preflight]
    P -->|missing/denied| X[Concrete runtime diagnostic before agent]
    P -->|ok or runtime-owned| B[Runtime-owned subprocess coordinator]
    B --> C{Child state}
    C -->|No child| D[Launch child and defer parent]
    C -->|Active| E[Parent waits/deferred]
    C -->|Completed accepted handoff| F[ParentSubprocessArtifactBridge]
    C -->|Completed no-go| G[Parent blocked with child no-go evidence]
    F --> H[Write parent managed evidence artifact]
    H --> I[Produced slot available with content hash]
    I --> J[Parent step completed]
    G --> K[Operator action shows exact child run/step/artifact]
    X --> K
